  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "運輸物流實習(二)",
    "sub_ename": "TRANSPORTATION AND LOGISTICS INTERNSHIP (2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程鼓勵本系大學生理論與實務整合，參與四年級下學期全學期實習，以增進就業競爭力。實習單位以與本系簽訂企業合作意願書之公民營運輸企業為限，學生提出申請，由課程委員會遴選優秀同學參加，實習時間4個半月。實習學生應於實習前參加本系舉辦之職前講習，實習期間學生應準時簽到上下班，填寫實習工作日誌(工作內容)、實習週誌(問題發掘與問題解決)與實習月報(問題討論與心得報告)。實習結束繳交實習心得書面報告，並進行口頭簡報。本課程每個月由實習單位指定之實習導師與本系輔導教師共同考評。",
    "describe_eh": "With an aim to integrate theory with practice, this course encourages students to participate internship in the second semester of their 4th grade to strengthen their competitiveness when looking for employment. Internship agents are limited to public or private transportation firms that agree to sign cooperative intention agreements with the department. Students interested in the internship are encouraged to apply and potential candidates are selected by the Course Planning Committee of the department. The internship periods last at least for four and a half months. Students have to take a pre-internship readiness program held by the department prior to the beginning of the internship. They are also required to come to work and get off duty as requested and complete daily, weekly, and monthly diaries or reports on time. At the end of the internship, students have to hand in an overall internship report and prepare for oral presentation. The performances of the students are jointly evaluated by an internship mentor appointed by the agent and the faculty member of the department.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 9.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "5.教授各運輸或物流系統之營運、企業經營管理之理論及實務概念",
      "describe_en": "5. Provide students with knowledge of the theories and practices of operations and business management in transportation and logistics systems."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "10.培養學生具備交通工程師與從業人員應具有之專業倫理",
      "describe_en": "10. Develop students’ understanding of professional ethics for transportation engineers and practitioners."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "12.培養學生簡報製作、報告撰寫、口頭報告以及提問研討之能力",
      "describe_en": "12. Develop students' skills in presentation, report writing, oral delivery, and academic discussion."
    }
  ],
